The legal text comes from an official publication of the Republic of Equatorial Guinea:

  Ley Núm. 1/2012, de fecha 16 de febrero, sobre la Constitución de la República de Guinea Ecuatorial (Ley
  Fundamental de Guinea Ecuatorial), as published by the Boletín Oficial del Estado de Guinea Ecuatorial
  (Presidencia del Gobierno, Malabo), https://boe.gob.gq/sites/default/files/2026-10/LEY%20FUNDAMENTAL_0.pdf
  (identical to https://boe.gob.gq/files/LEY%20FUNDAMENTAL.pdf), retrieved 29 October 2026.

  Ley Núm. 4/2021, de fecha 3 de Diciembre, General de Trabajo en la República de Guinea Ecuatorial, as printed by
  the Dirección General del Boletín Oficial del Estado (Malabo, 31 January 2022), copy held by the Observatoire des
  Forêts d'Afrique Centrale (COMIFAC), https://www.observatoire-comifac.net, retrieved 30 October 2026.

The Boletín Oficial del Estado states no licence for its files. They are official legal texts; their copyright
status is not confirmed here, and they are reproduced with the attribution above.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph per line;
spacing and quotes were normalised; the title page and the electronic-signature line printed on every page were
removed; headings were gathered in one structure file; and the text was arranged as git commits. The wording of the
law was not changed. Neither the Boletín Oficial del Estado nor COMIFAC endorses this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) are
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
